{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种很郑重、近乎非要把事情说清的投入，和一种仍然无法真正落定的不确定同时存在。它不是轻飘的犹豫：事情已经有了很重的分量，只是人还没有找到一个自己能够真正相信的回答。\",\"thread\":\"此刻最先确定下来的不是答案，而是这件事不能被随便带过。正因为已经认真到不能敷衍，每一次想把它暂时说定，都会很快显出还有什么没有被容纳进去；于是强烈的投入并没有带来确定，反而使不能确定这件事本身变得更清楚。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"这件事已经重要到不能用一个勉强说得通的回答把它安顿下来。\",\"强烈地想要确定，并不等于已经有了足以让自己相信的确定。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dccc58e9-c5e8-4fc8-bc73-d7e9d75e7276", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215754080989Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.188, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:58:17.270965+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "296a655378c1c449958c7c8186ca1a443f390ddb4dd5aaa0fd11b5f082c6a631", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline